# Cloudflare Pages — tapper shell cache + security headers.
# CSP keeps 'unsafe-inline' (decrypt / locale / SOS / SW register are inline)
# and media-src blob: (the SOS siren WAV is generated in JS, played via blob:).
# #d= payload is never an HTTP cache key.
# Shell HTML: short max-age + SWR so a second band tap is fast even before the
# service worker claims the client. SW cache-first + activate bucket clear is
# still the source of truth after install. github.io ignores _headers.
# AASA Content-Type is for Cloudflare Pages only — github.io ignores _headers
# but still serves the files (Apple accepts octet-stream there).
#
# RM-06 additions (2026-09-30):
#   - CSP + frame/permissions headers on /, /portal/, /portal/*, /store/, /store/*
#   - connect-src includes Supabase project origin on portal routes
#   - Existing tapper headers are preserved byte-for-byte
#   - TODO (store owner): replace connect-src 'self' with exact Stripe/payment
#     origins when checkout JS is wired up.

/apple-app-site-association
  Content-Type: application/json

/.well-known/apple-app-site-association
  Content-Type: application/json

